BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-192176@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260629T140000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260629T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260629T154500
SUMMARY:Revolutionary Spaces: The Road to 250 
LOCATION:Offsite: Revolutionary Spaces
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: You are on 
 Waitlist\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/192176\n\nIn 
 anticipation of America's 250th anniversary\, members are invited to exper
 ience Boston's revolutionary history through an exclusive guided tour host
 ed by Revolutionary Spaces. The afternoon will begin with a welcome and in
 troduction from President and CEO Dr. Nathaniel Sheidley before exploring 
 some of the city's most significant historic landmarks\, including the Old
  State House and Old South Meeting House.\n\nAlong the way\, members will 
 gain deeper insight into the events\, people\, and ideas that shaped the n
 ation's founding through guided access to permanent exhibitions and histor
 ic spaces. The experience will conclude with rare private access to the Ol
 d State House Clock Tower and Old South Meeting House Clock Tower\, offeri
 ng a unique perspective on two of Boston's most iconic landmarks.\n\n*This
  event is complimentary and reserved for members only.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/192176
CATEGORIES:The Arts
END:VEVENT
