 saxophonist and composer Samuel Batista. Joined by piano\, drums and bass\
 , this dynamic trio seamlessly blends jazz with rich cultural influences. 
 Grab a signature cocktail from the Little Bar\, settle into the Reading Ro
 om\, and let their captivating music transport you on a journey through ja
 zz and heritage.\n\n*Reservations are not required. Please note that seati
 ng is first come\, first served.
