SUMMARY:Sail Boston: Luxury Yacht Valiant
LOCATION:Offsite: Rowes Wharf Gate C
DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: $277.65 per person\nStatus: Wait
 list Only\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/191172\n\nAs
  Boston welcomes a once-in-a-generation gathering of the world's most magn
 ificent tall ships in celebration of America's 250th anniversary\, join fe
 llow members aboard luxury yacht Valiant for an unforgettable evening on t
 he harbor.\n\nDeparting from Rowes Wharf\, this exclusive cruise offers a 
 front-row vantage point to Sail Boston 2026\, as an international fleet of
  historic tall ships and military vessels fills the harbor in a remarkable
  display of maritime tradition and global camaraderie. As dusk settles ove
 r the city\, enjoy unparalleled views of the fleet before the evening culm
 inates with a spectacular fireworks display illuminating the Boston skylin
 e.\n\nThroughout the cruise\, guests will enjoy an open bar and a selectio
 n of elevated bites while taking in one of the most anticipated events of 
 the Semiquincentennial celebration from the best seat in the harbor.\n\n*T
 his event is offered at $295 per person and is reserved for members\, pl
 us one registered guest age 21+. Complimentary light bites and refreshment
 s will be served. Complimentary light bites and refreshments will be serv
 ed. Please note that this event will take place rain or shine. Valiant is 
 partially covered\, and in the event of rough water conditions\, the vesse
 l will remain docked. Members will meet at Rowes Wharf Gate C\, located di
 rectly in front of the Boston Harbor Hotel. Parking is available at the B
 oston Harbor Hotel.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/191172
CATEGORIES:Member Mixer
END:VEVENT
