 lability: 2 spots left\nStatus: Available\nTime: 12 PM – 11 AM\nEvent UR
 L: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/189418\n\nExperience Oktoberfes
 t like never before.\n\nMore than just a visit\, join fellow 'Quin members
  for our return to Oktoberfest—an unforgettable experience celebrating t
 he very best of Bavarian culture\, tradition\, and hospitality. Discover t
 he vibrant spirit of Munich and the festive atmosphere surrounding the wor
 ld-famous beer halls\, all while enjoying exclusive access to the iconic M
 arstall-Festzelt beer tent. This exceptional journey will once again be ho
 sted by 'Quin Managing Director\, Matthias Kiehm\, a native of Germany\, w
 ho will share his deep local knowledge\, personal connections\, and passio
 n for the region throughout the trip.\n\nThe luxurious Seehotel Überfahrt
  will serve as your five-star home away from home\, offering the perfect b
 lend of elegance and comfort. Nestled near the stunning Lake Tegernsee\, t
 his exquisite retreat features a renowned spa\, exceptional dining\, and i
 mpeccable service\, creating the ideal setting for an unforgettable Oktobe
 rfest adventure.\n\nIncluded in the price is four nights’ accommodation 
 at the 5-star Seehotel Überfahrt in Rottach-Egern\, access to the Marstal
 l-Festzelt beer tent\, all formal dining experiences and activities\, as w
 ell as all taxes and gratuities. Flights to and from Munich\, your transfe
 r to and from the hotel\, insurance and any items of a personal nature are
  NOT included.\n\nDeluxe Mountain View | Single $4\,800 | Double $7\,300\n
 Deluxe Lake View | Single $5\,100 | Double $7\,600\nJunior Suite Mountain 
 View | Single $6\,000 | Double $8\,500\nMaisonette Lake View | Single $8\,
 300 | Double $10\,800\nTegernsee Suite Lake View | Single $9\,900 | Double
  $12\,400\n\nReservations are non-refundable and non-transferable in order
  to guarantee accommodations during the high season. Payment is due in fu
 ll at the time of booking. \n\nTo ensure the best possible experience for
  all attendees\, we kindly ask that members inform us in advance of any ph
 ysical limitations\, mobility considerations\, or accessibility needs we s
 hould be aware of. All members will also be asked to sign The 'Quin's stan
 dard liability agreement in advance of travel.
